msgstr "Alterum exemplar scandere"

#: src/onboarding.py:734
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Alterum exemplar recordari non potuit"

#: src/onboarding.py:735
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must "
"still be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than"
" turning it off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from S"
"ettings."
msgstr ""
"Exemplar primum tuum servatur, ergo facies login iam operatur. Cubicul"
"um adhuc satis clarum erit ut faciem tuam videas — lucem potius quam e"
"am vertere — deinde iterum conare, vel omittere et exemplar postea a O"
"ccasus addere."

#: src/onboarding.py:769
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Secundi scan: diversis lucendi"

#: src/onboarding.py:771
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on o"
"r off, move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep y"
"our face clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Primum exemplum servavit. Nunc lucem muta - exempli gratia lucernam in"
" vel off verte, e fenestra recede, vel alio cubiculi lumine utere - fa"
"c vultum tuum clare conspicuum, deinde iterum Scan premunt."

